          "light": "Fourthly, if God has so approved of women meeting together to pray in Gospel times, that he even used the occasion to make known to them his mind and will concerning Jesus Christ, then it is lawful for women to pray together. But God has so approved of their meeting to pray together (Acts 16:13), by which text it appears it was a frequent practice for women to meet and pray together.",
